<title>USA: Lehman names new U.S. equity research head.</title>
<headline>Lehman names new U.S. equity research head.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Inc said on Tuesday it named Joseph Amato, former director the firm's high yield research group, as director of U.S. equity research.</p>
<p>Amato joined Lehman in 1994, the company said.</p>
